# 2026-11-09T10:18:11+11:00 tenant-b 上 2 个 Pod（各 4000 MiB、20% 算力）运行后，逐个查询看板面板用的表达式
# Prometheus 抓取目标
http://172.18.0.1:18080/metrics up 
[租户就绪] sum(gputenant_tenant_ready)
    -> 1 series: =2
[租户就绪] count(gputenant_tenant_ready)
    -> 1 series: =2
[降级的租户] sum(gputenant_tenant_degraded) or vector(0)
    -> 1 series: =0
[firing 的告警] sum(gputenant_alerts_firing) or vector(0)
    -> 1 series: =0
[运行中的任务] gputenant_tasks_running
    -> 1 series: =0
[状态数据延迟] time() - gputenant_refresh_timestamp_seconds
    -> 1 series: =29.5
[vGPU 分配率] gputenant_gpu_vgpu_allocated / gputenant_gpu_vgpu_capacity
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0.3, tenant-b=0.1
[显存分配率] gputenant_gpu_memory_allocated_mib / gputenant_gpu_memory_capacity_mib
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0.732, tenant-b=0.244
[算力分配率] gputenant_gpu_cores_allocated / gputenant_gpu_cores_capacity
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0.9, tenant-b=0.2
[显存分配率（随时间）] gputenant_gpu_memory_allocated_mib / gputenant_gpu_memory_capacity_mib
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0.732, tenant-b=0.244
[开通进度（完成的步骤）] gputenant_tenant_steps_done
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=14, tenant-b=14
[开通进度（完成的步骤）] max(gputenant_tenant_steps_total)
    -> 1 series: =14
[租户状态] gputenant_tenant_ready
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=1, tenant-b=1
[租户状态] gputenant_tenant_degraded
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0, tenant-b=0
[租户状态] gputenant_tenant_steps_done
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=14, tenant-b=14
[租户状态] gputenant_gpu_vgpu_allocated
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=3, tenant-b=2
[租户状态] gputenant_gpu_vgpu_capacity
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=10, tenant-b=20
[租户状态] gputenant_alerts_firing
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0, tenant-b=0
[租户状态] gputenant_tenant_inspect_errors
    -> 2 series: tenant-a=0, tenant-b=0
[firing 的告警] gputenant_alert_firing == 1
    -> 0 series: (empty)
[任务平均耗时（本 API 实例启动以来）] sum by (op, result) (gputenant_task_duration_seconds_sum) / sum by (op, result) (gputenant_task_duration_seconds_count)
    -> 0 series: (empty)
[任务结果（本 API 实例启动以来）] sum by (op, result) (gputenant_tasks_total)
    -> 0 series: (empty)

# Grafana 加载的看板
gputenant 多租户 GPU: 15 panels, provisioned=true
